@startuml
' Notes of their own (`note "…" as N1`, or `note as N2` and a block)
' are laid out among the states, at the top or inside one, and are
' no state of the machine.
[*] --> Idle
Idle --> Busy : go
Busy --> Idle : done
note "Lives on its own,\nbeside the states" as N1
state Busy {
  [*] --> Working
  note as N2
    Inside the state,
    in a block.
  end note
}
@enduml
